# Submodules of this catkin workspace.
#
# src/rosaria is pinned to the upstream commit recorded in this repository's
# history; tests/run.sh verifies that it resolves and that the checkout matches
# the pin.
#
# src/waypoints is ALSO a gitlink (index mode 160000) in this repository's
# history, but its origin could not be identified, so it deliberately has NO
# entry here: inventing a URL would be worse than the honest gap. See README.md,
# "The waypoints package is missing" and tests/known-gaps.txt.
[submodule "src/rosaria"]
	path = src/rosaria
	url = https://github.com/amor-ros-pkg/rosaria.git
